{"hymn":"S679","parent":"E1223","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"Rodead a Sion y miradla","subtitle":"La iglesia—Como ciudad de Dios","syl":{"n1":["Ro","i"],"n2":["de","m"],"n3":["ad","t"],"n4":"a","n5":"Sion","n6":"y","n7":["mi","i"],"n8":["rad","m"],"n9":["la,","t"],"n11":["Ro","i"],"n12":["dead","m"],"n13":["la","t"],"n14":["lle","i"],"n15":["nos","t"],"n16":["de‿a","i"],"n17":["mor;","t"],"n19":["Con","i"],"n20":["tad","t"],"n21":["ho","i"],"n22":["y","t"],"n23":["to","i"],"n24":["das","t"],"n25":"sus","n26":["to","i"],"n27":["rres,","t"],"n29":["An","i"],"n30":["dan","m"],"n32":["do","t"],"n33":"por","n34":["su‿al","i"],"n35":["re‿de","m"],"n36":["dor,","t"],"n38":["An","i"],"n39":["dan","m"],"n41":["do","t"],"n42":"por","n43":["su‿al","i"],"n44":["re‿de","m"],"n45":["dor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Oh, contemplad sus baluartes,","Sus muros hoy contemplad;","Oh, contemplad sus baluartes","Y en sus palacios andad,","Y en sus palacios andad."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Cuán elevada, cuán bella!","¡Gran gozo a la tierra es!","¡Cuán elevada, cuán bella!","Es Sion la ciudad del gran Rey,","Es Sion la ciudad del gran Rey."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Oh, desde Sion brota un río,","Muy hondo y ancho en verdad;","Con sus corrientes el río","Alegra de Dios la ciudad,","Alegra de Dios la ciudad."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["En Sion te espera alabanzas,","Loor te espera, Señor;","En Sion te espera alabanzas,","Pues Sion está llena de Dios,","Pues Sion está llena de Dios."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["En Sión, Señor, eres grande","Y digno de admiración;","En la ciudad elevada","Se canta alabanzas a Dios,","Se canta alabanzas a Dios."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["En Sion, Señor, te bendigan,","Es Tu santa habitación;","En Sion, Señor, te bendigan,","Con toda alabanza y loor,","Con toda alabanza y loor."]},{"label":"8.","lines":["En Sion, que Dios os bendiga,","En Sion, aún más y más;","En Sion, que Dios os bendiga","A todos con vida eternal,","A todos con vida eternal."]},{"label":"9.","lines":["¡Mirad, oh cuán delicioso","Con los hermanos estar!","¡Mirad, oh cuán delicioso","En tal armonía morar,","En tal armonía morar!"]},{"label":"10.","lines":["Oh, dilo a todos los hombres,","Oh, dilo hoy por doquier,","Que el Espíritu llama","Y dice con la Novia: \"Ven\",","Y dice con la Novia: \"Ven\"."]}]}